{"title":"Pineapple","sourceTitle":"Pineapple/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Pineapple\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Pineapple (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Pineapple/es\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Piña (9% translated)\" lang=\"es\" dir=\"ltr\">español</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Pineapple/fr\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Ananas (62% translated)\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\">français</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Pineapple/it\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Ananas (3% translated)\" lang=\"it\" dir=\"ltr\">italiano</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Pineapple/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Ананас (6% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Pineapple/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"菠萝 (100% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"center\" style=\"background-color: #eee; border-style: solid; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 4px; border-color: #88acf5; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 85%; width: 90%; padding: 0.2em; margin: 0.5em auto; margin-left:0px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: flex-start; align-items: center; padding-left: 10px\">\n<div style=\"margin-left: 10px; text-align: left;\">\n<p>Esta página foi verificada pela última vez para a versão do Vintage Story <b>1.19.0-pre.10</b>.\n</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"float:right;\">\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"position:relative; border-radius:7px; font-size:90%; width:300px; float:right; margin-left:5px; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-top-right-radius:7px; border-top-left-radius:7px; text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Fatias de abacaxi</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#d3ab92\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Fruit-pineapple.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/d/da/Fruit-pineapple.png/100px-Fruit-pineapple.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/d/da/Fruit-pineapple.png/150px-Fruit-pineapple.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/d/da/Fruit-pineapple.png/200px-Fruit-pineapple.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Empilhável</b>\n</td>\n<td>64<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Comida</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Saciedade</b>\n</td>\n<td>80 raw, <br />120 in Meals\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Categoria</b>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Fruta\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Transitável</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Tempo fresco</b>\n</td>\n<td>48 horas\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Rot#Notes\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Rot\">Tempo de apodrecimento</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>12 horas\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Rot#Notes\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Rot\">Taxa de apodrecimento</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>0.25<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"Bloba\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px; border-bottom-right-radius:7px; border-bottom-left-radius:7px;\"><a href=\"/Items\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Items\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Itens</b></font></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"float:right;\">\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"position:relative; border-radius:7px; font-size:90%; width:300px; float:right; margin-left:5px; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-top-right-radius:7px; border-top-left-radius:7px; text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>abacaxi</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#d3ab92\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Pineapple.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/f/fb/Pineapple.png/100px-Pineapple.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/f/fb/Pineapple.png/150px-Pineapple.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/f/fb/Pineapple.png/200px-Pineapple.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Material</b>\n</td>\n<td>Planta<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Empilhável</b>\n</td>\n<td>8<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Transitável</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Tempo fresco</b>\n</td>\n<td>6.5 dias\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Rot#Notes\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Rot\">Tempo de apodrecimento</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>48 horas\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Rot#Notes\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Rot\">Taxa de apodrecimento</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>2<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td></tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"Bloba\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px; border-bottom-right-radius:7px; border-bottom-left-radius:7px;\"><a href=\"/Items\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Items\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Itens</b></font></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p><b>Abacaxi</b> são uma fonte de frutas <a href=\"/Satiety\" title=\"Satiety\">nutrição</a>. São as únicas frutas cultivadas via <a href=\"/Farming\" title=\"Farming\">sementes</a>. Eles não podem ser comidos sem um <a href=\"/Knife\" title=\"Knife\">faca</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Obtendo\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Obtendo</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Cultivo\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Cultivo</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Uso\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Uso</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Armazenamento\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Armazenamento</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Histórico\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Histórico</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Observações\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Observações</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Galeria\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Galeria</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Veja_também\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Veja também</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Referências\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Referências</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<p><span id=\"Obtaining\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtendo\">Obtendo</span></h2>\n<p>Pequenos trechos de plantações de abacaxi podem ser encontrados durante a exploração, em áreas com os seguintes <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Temperature#Effect_on_plants\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Temperature\">temperatura</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Temperature#Effect_on_plants\" title=\"Temperature\"> </a></span>, <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Weather#Precipitation\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Weather\">precipitação</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Weather#Precipitation\" title=\"Weather\"> </a></span> e <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/World_generation#Tree_Generation\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/World generation\">florestamento</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/World_generation#Tree_Generation\" title=\"World generation\"> </a></span>. \n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Parâmetro</th>\n<th>Min. valor</th>\n<th>Máx. valor\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Temperature\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Temperature\">Temperatura</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Temperature\" title=\"Temperature\"> </a></span></td>\n<td>26</td>\n<td>45\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Weather\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Weather\">Chuva</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Weather\" title=\"Weather\"> </a></span></td>\n<td>0.7</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Floresta</td>\n<td>0.6</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Os pedaços que satisfazem estas condições têm uma probabilidade de 9% de gerar 0-8 culturas de ananás,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> o que pode incluir uma mistura de culturas maduras e imaturas.\n</p><p>Os jogadores que começarem em <abbr title=\"100k polar-equator distance\">default Temperate area</abbr> precisarão viajar dezenas de milhares de quarteirões ao sul para chegar às regiões onde os abacaxis provavelmente serão gerados.\n</p><p>Sementes de abacaxi não podem ser <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/trading\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/trading\">comprado</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Trading\" title=\"Trading\"> </a></span> ou encontradas em <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Cracked_Vessel\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Cracked Vessel\">vasos rachados</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Cracked_Vessel\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cracked Vessel\"> </a></span>.\n</p><p><span id=\"Cultivation\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Cultivo\">Cultivo</span></h2>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/File:Pineapple-fully-grown-crop.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/f/fd/Pineapple-fully-grown-crop.png/200px-Pineapple-fully-grown-crop.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"225\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/f/fd/Pineapple-fully-grown-crop.png/300px-Pineapple-fully-grown-crop.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/f/fd/Pineapple-fully-grown-crop.png/400px-Pineapple-fully-grown-crop.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"445\" data-file-height=\"501\" /></a><figcaption>Abacaxi maduro</figcaption></figure>\n<p>As culturas de abacaxi toleram temperaturas de 6 a 48°C.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> Se a temperatura cair abaixo de 6°C ou exceder 48°C, a cultura de abacaxi se tornará <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Temperature#Effect_on_plants\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Temperature\">\"atrofiado\"</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Temperature#Effect_on_plants\" title=\"Temperature\"> </a></span> e começará a acumular danos. As colheitas atrofiadas de abacaxi renderão 50% do normal quando colhidas. Se acumularem danos suficientes para morrerem por frio ou calor excessivo, as colheitas de abacaxi produzirão 50% do normal quando colhidas<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-8\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>, mas o jogador terá garantida 1 semente, independentemente do estágio de crescimento.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-9\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-9\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>9<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>As culturas de abacaxi consomem 15<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-10\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-10\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>10<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Farming#Soil_nutrients\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Farming\">N (nitrogênio)</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Farming#Soil_nutrients\" title=\"Farming\"> </a></span> do solo em 16 estágios<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-11\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-11\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>11<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> de crescimento.\nDurante os estágios 9-12, as culturas de abacaxi alimentam <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bees\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Bees\">abelhas</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bees\" title=\"Bees\"> </a></span> e <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Butterfly\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Butterfly\">borboletas</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Butterfly\" title=\"Butterfly\"> </a></span>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-12\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-12\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>12<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> As culturas de abacaxi levam <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Farming#Time\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Farming\">6 meses</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Farming#Time\" title=\"Farming\"> </a></span><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-13\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-13\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>13<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> para amadurecer, (54 dias nas configurações <abbr title=\"9 day per month\">default</abbr>, assumindo uma taxa de crescimento próxima de 100%. Baixo <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Farming#Moisture\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Farming\">umidade</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Farming#Moisture\" title=\"Farming\"> </a></span> ou <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Farming#Soil_nutrients\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Farming\">níveis de nutrientes</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Farming#Soil_nutrients\" title=\"Farming\"> </a></span> podem atrasar significativamente a maturação.\n</p><p>Os abacaxis podem ser colhidos \n<abbr title=\"Botão esquerdo do mouse\">quebrando</abbr> da colheita, não é necessário <abbr title=\"a scythe harvests more blocks at once\">tool</abbr>. \nCada bloco de abacaxi maduro renderá 1 pacote de sementes de abacaxi<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-14\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-14\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>14<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> e <abbr title=\"one with a 20% chance of a second\">1-2</abbr>. A colheita nos estágios 11-15 tem 99% de chance de obter 1 abacaxi<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-15\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-15\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>15<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>, mas nenhum pacote de sementes. A colheita antes do estágio 11 tem 0% de chance de obter abacaxi e 70% de chance de obter 1 pacote de sementes.\n</p><p><span id=\"Usage\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Uso\">Uso</span></h2>\n<p>Um abacaxi não pode ser comido inteiro: deve ser cortado em rodelas de abacaxi colocando-o na grau de artesanato com um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/knife\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/knife\">faca</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Knife\" title=\"Knife\"> </a></span>. Um abacaxi produz 12 fatias de abacaxi.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-16\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-16\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>16<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> \nFatias de abacaxi podem ser usadas como ingrediente de fruta <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/cooking\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/cooking\">cozimento</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Cooking\" title=\"Cooking\"> </a></span> em ensopados, mingaus e tortas, ou cozidas com mel para fazer <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Food_preservation#Jam\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Food preservation\">geleia</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Food_preservation#Jam\" title=\"Food preservation\"> </a></span>. Nas refeições, cada fatia de abacaxi contribui com 120 frutas <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/satiety\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/satiety\">saciedade</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Satiety\" title=\"Satiety\"> </a></span>,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-17\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-17\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>17<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> em comparação com 80 saciedade quando comida crua.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-18\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-18\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>18<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> Fatias de abacaxi também podem ser espremidas, produzindo suco de abacaxi que pode ser fermentado em <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Alcohol_Brewing\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Alcohol Brewing\">vinho de abacaxi</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Alcohol_Brewing\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Alcohol Brewing\"> </a></span>. \n</p><p><br />\n<span id=\"Storage\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Armazenamento\">Armazenamento</span></h2>\n<p>Como todos os alimentos, o abacaxi se beneficia do armazenamento em <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Room#Cellar\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Room\">despensa</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Room#Cellar\" title=\"Room\"> </a></span> e tende a se beneficiar do armazenamento em recipientes durante o tempo frio.\nOs abacaxis podem ser armazenados inteiros ou em rodelas de abacaxi.\nAbacaxi inteiros podem ser colocados no chão como modelos 3D, 4 abacaxis por bloco.\n</p><p>A geléia tem uma vida útil longa, especialmente em uma panela fechada.\n</p><p><span id=\"History\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Hist.C3.B3rico\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Histórico\">Histórico</span></h2>\n<ul><li>A partir da versão 1.18.10, o abacaxi é a única cultura frutífera (arbustos e árvores frutíferas não são considerados culturas).</li>\n<li>A partir da versão 1.18.10, o abacaxi tem o maior tempo de crescimento de qualquer cultura.</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\"Observa.C3.A7.C3.B5es\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Observações\">Observações</span></h2>\n<ul><li>O valor \"substituível\" de um abacaxi em crescimento é 3.000.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-19\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-19\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>19<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> O valor \"substituível\" de um abacaxi colhido é 5.000.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-20\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-20\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>20<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li>\n<li>Queima por 10 segundos com capacidade de 600 graus.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-21\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-21\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>21<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li>\n<li>Não está claro se a <i>causa</i> da morte da colheita é importante para o mecanismo de piedade de fornecer uma semente se a colheita morrer, não importa quão imatura seja a colheita.</li>\n<li>Compare as taxas de mortalidade e saciedade da fruta versus o suco e o vinho.</li></ul>\n<p><span id=\"Gallery\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Galeria\">Galeria</span></h2>\n<p><span id=\"See&#95;also\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Veja_tamb.C3.A9m\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Veja_também\">Veja também</span></h2>\n<p><span id=\"References\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Refer.C3.AAncias\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Referências\">Referências</span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap mw-references-columns\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Line 3 of %appdata%\\Roaming\\Vintagestory\\assets\\survival\\itemtypes\\food\\fruit.json</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-2\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Lines 113-117 of %appdata%\\Roaming\\Vintagestory\\assets\\survival\\itemtypes\\food\\fruit.json</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-3\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Line 12 of %appdata%\\Roaming\\Vintagestory\\assets\\survival\\blocktypes\\food\\pineapple.json</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-4\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-4\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Line 9 of %appdata%\